{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18765","headline":"观柘枝舞二首 一 · 刘禹锡","name":"观柘枝舞二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡服何葳蕤，僊僊登绮墀。\n神飙猎红蕖，龙烛暎金枝。\n垂带覆纤腰，安钿当妩眉。\n翘袖中繁鼓，倾眸遡华榱。\n燕秦有旧曲，淮南多冶词。\n欲见倾城处，君看赴节时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}